DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nHigh Line Comedy Cl
	ub is a premier stand-up venue on Manhattan’s West Side\, featuring top co
	medians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, The Tonight Show with Jim
	my Fallon\, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, and The Daily Show with J
	on Stewart. \nTucked away inside an immersive mini-golf venue\, High Line 
	Comedy Club is a hidden gem in NYC’s comedy scene offering a one-of-a-kind
	 entertainment experience. The lineup includes both established headliners
	 and rising stars delivering top-tier performances night after night. \nEv
	ent Details\nDate: Select your dates directly in the ticket selector\nTime
	: 7pm & 9pm show times\nLocation: High Line Comedy Club\, 446 W 14th St\, 
	New York\, NY 10014\nAge Requirement: 21+ only\nNote: 1 item (food or drin
	k) purchase minimum \nAbout the Venue\nHigh Line Comedy Club is located at
	 446 West 14th Street in New York’s vibrant Meatpacking District. With roo
	ftop views\, a fantastic menu of food\, and a vibrant atmosphere\, the clu
	b offers a high-energy\, intimate setting for unforgettable live comedy. \
	nWhat to Expect\nExpect a night of world-class stand-up comedy from comedi
	ans you’ve seen on Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central. The unique mini-gol
	f setting adds an extra layer of fun to your evening out in NYC. \nShows r
	un at 7pm and 9pm\, so you can choose the time that works best for you. Ar
	rive early to grab a drink and settle in for a great night of laughs. \nTi
	cket Information\nTickets start from $26.00. Early Bird tickets are availa
	ble at a discount. Age limit strictly 21+. All sales are final. \nGet Tick
