DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets \nResale Tickets \nKill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden (Night 2)
	\nKill Tony returns to Madison Square Garden for Night 2 on Saturday\, Aug
	ust 8\, 2026! Hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe\, this is a completely separate s
	how from Night 1 with its own unique lineup of comedians and celebrity gue
	sts. Each night of Kill Tony at MSG is a standalone event — don’t miss eit
	her night of this historic two-night run at The World’s Most Famous Arena.
	 \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: 
	Madison Square Garden\nAddress: 4 Pennsylvania Plaza\, New York\, NY 10001
	\nCapacity: ~20\,000\nParking: Available at MSG parking facilities and nea
	rby garages\nAge Requirement: All ages (18+ recommended for content) \nAbo
	ut Kill Tony\nKill Tony is a weekly live podcast hosted by comedian Tony H
	inchcliffe\, featuring unknown comedians performing 60-second stand-up set
	s judged by Tony and rotating celebrity guests. The show has grown from a 
	small Austin club to selling out the world’s biggest arenas\, including tw
	o consecutive nights at Madison Square Garden. Each taping is completely u
	nique\, making every show a must-see experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nTony 
	Hinchcliffe hosting a live taping of the Kill Tony podcast\nA brand-new li
	neup of unknown comedians and celebrity guests (different from Night 1)\n6
	0-second stand-up sets with live feedback and crowd interaction\nUnfiltere
	d\, raw comedy in front of a massive MSG crowd\nAn electric Saturday night
	 atmosphere at The Garden\nA completely unique show — no two Kill Tony nig
	hts are the same\n\nVenue Information\nMadison Square Garden\, located at 
	4 Pennsylvania Plaza in Midtown Manhattan\, is the most famous arena in th
	e world\, hosting over 300 events per year. With a capacity of approximate
	ly 20\,000\, MSG offers world-class amenities\, multiple food and beverage
	 options\, and easy access via Penn Station and multiple subway lines. \nT
	icket Information\nOfficial tickets start at $605 and are available throug
	h Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. Nigh
	t 2 tickets are sold separately from Night 1. Secure your seats now — this
	 show is expected to sell out! \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis 
	post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase ticket
	s through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show t
	imes subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garden-night-
	two/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garde
	n-night-two/
LOCATION:Madison Square Garden\, 4 Pennsylvania Plaza\, New York\, NY\, 100
	01\, United States
