SUMMARY:Please Don't Destroy: Live LIVE at The Pageant
DTSTAMP:20260808T091833Z
DTSTART:20260808T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout Please Don’t Destroy\nP
	lease Don’t Destroy is the beloved comedy trio of Ben Marshall\, John Higg
	ins\, and Martin Herlihy — three best friends who rose to fame through the
	ir viral sketch comedy videos on Saturday Night Live. \nKnown for their ab
	surdist humor\, deadpan delivery\, and brilliantly crafted sketches\, Plea
	se Don’t Destroy have become one of the most exciting live comedy acts tou
	ring today. Their chemistry is undeniable\, and their live shows bring a w
	hole new energy to the material fans already love. \nEvent Details\n\nDate
	: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show: 7:00 PM\nVenue: The P
	ageant\, 6161 Delmar Blvd\, Saint Louis\, MO 63112\nAges: All Ages\nTicket
	 Prices: Starting at $27.00\n\nAbout The Pageant\nThe Pageant is one of St
	. Louis’s premier live entertainment venues\, located in the vibrant Delma
	r Loop neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 2\,500\, it offers a
	n intimate yet energetic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. \n
	The venue features excellent sightlines from nearly every spot on the floo
	r\, a full bar\, and a dedicated balcony section for those who prefer a mo
	re relaxed viewing experience. The Pageant is known for its top-notch soun
	d system and welcoming vibe\, making it a favorite for both performers and
	 fans alike. \nParking is available in nearby lots and street parking alon
	g Delmar Blvd. The venue is also accessible via MetroLink at the Delmar Lo
	op station. \nWhat to Expect\nPlease Don’t Destroy: Live is a full-length 
	sketch comedy show featuring original material\, fan-favorite bits\, and p
	lenty of surprises. The trio brings their signature brand of weird\, wonde
	rful humor to the stage in a format that goes beyond what you’ve seen on S
	NL. \nExpect audience interaction\, live music elements\, and the kind of 
	spontaneous energy that only comes from seeing these guys perform in perso
	n. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering them for the first time\, 
	this show promises an unforgettable night of laughter. \nTicket Informatio
	n\nTickets for Please Don’t Destroy: Live at The Pageant start at $27.00. 
	Secure your seats now before they sell out! \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tic
	kets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you pu
	rchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are 
	final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for en
	try.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/please-dont-destroy-live-at-the-p
	ageant/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/please-dont-destroy-live-at-the-pagean
	t/
