	ckets\nResale Tickets \nDaniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur (Night 2)\
	nScottish stand-up sensation Daniel Sloss returns to Boston’s iconic Wilbu
	r Theatre for a second night with his brand-new show BITTER on Saturday\, 
	August 8\, 2026. Following the massive success of his Netflix specials\, S
	loss is back with his darkest\, funniest material yet. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\nAddre
	ss: 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA 02116\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nParkin
	g: Discounted parking at 660 Washington St. Garage \nAbout Daniel Sloss\nD
	aniel Sloss is a Scottish comedian who has taken the world by storm with h
	is Netflix specials Dark and Jigsaw\, which have been credited with inspir
	ing thousands of breakups worldwide. His comedy is brutally honest\, deepl
	y personal\, and laugh-out-loud funny. BITTER is his most anticipated new 
	show yet. \nWhat to Expect\n\nDaniel Sloss’s brand-new stand-up show: BITT
	ER\nDark\, intelligent humor with emotional depth\nOne of the most talked-
	about comedians in the world\nAn intimate evening at Boston’s beloved Wilb
	ur Theatre\nA second chance to catch this sold-out sensation\n\nVenue Info
	rmation\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved comedy and entertainme
	nt venues\, located at 246 Tremont St. in the heart of the city’s Theatre 
	District. It offers an intimate atmosphere with excellent acoustics and si
	ghtlines. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $90. Don’t miss your ch
	ance to see Daniel Sloss live — Night 1 sold out fast! \nOfficial Tickets\
	nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission
