	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJessica Kirson LIVE at Sound Waves at Hard Rock Ho
	tel & Casino Atlantic City\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughter as 
	the incomparable Jessica Kirson takes the stage at Sound Waves at Hard Roc
	k Hotel & Casino Atlantic City on Saturday\, August 8\, 2026. One of the m
	ost dynamic and physically hilarious comedians performing today\, Jessica 
	delivers a high-energy show that leaves audiences in tears — from laughing
	 so hard. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM
	 (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Sound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino A
	tlantic City\nAddress: 1000 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401\nAge Requ
	irement: All ages welcome (under 18 must be accompanied by an adult)\nPark
	ing: Available at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City \nAbout Jessica K
	irson\nJessica Kirson is a powerhouse comedian known for her explosive ene
	rgy\, fearless crowd work\, and deeply funny character-driven material. Sh
	e has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Comedy Central\, and released multipl
	e acclaimed specials. A favorite in Atlantic City and beyond\, Jessica con
	sistently delivers one of the most entertaining live comedy experiences an
	ywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy\, physically hilarious stand-up co
	medy from start to finish\nJessica’s signature crowd interaction and impro
	vised moments\nNew material alongside fan-favorite bits\nAn intimate yet e
	lectric atmosphere at Sound Waves\nA show that will have you laughing unti
	l it hurts\n\nVenue Information\nSound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino A
	tlantic City is an intimate\, state-of-the-art entertainment venue located
	 inside the Hard Rock Hotel & Casino at 1000 Boardwalk. With exceptional a
	coustics and a cozy atmosphere\, it’s the perfect setting for an up-close 
	comedy experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $72. Don’t wait 
	— Jessica Kirson shows in Atlantic City sell out fast. Grab your seats now
	! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links.
	 We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extr
	a cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid 
	photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/je
	ssica-kirson-live-at-sound-waves-at-hard-rock-hotel-casino-atlantic-city/\
