SUMMARY:Jerry Seinfeld LIVE at Acrisure Amphitheater
DTSTAMP:20260808T091833Z
DTSTART:20260808T201500Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Jerry Sein
	feld\nJerry Seinfeld is one of the most iconic comedians in the history of
	 stand-up comedy. Best known as the co-creator and star of the legendary N
	BC sitcom Seinfeld\, which ran from 1989 to 1998 and is widely considered 
	one of the greatest television shows ever made\, Jerry has never stopped p
	erforming live stand-up comedy throughout his entire career. \nHis observa
	tional comedy style — finding humor in the mundane details of everyday lif
	e — has influenced generations of comedians. From his early days on the Ne
	w York comedy circuit to his Netflix special 23 Hours to Kill and his film
	 Unfrosted\, Seinfeld remains one of the sharpest and most disciplined com
	edians working today. \nSeeing Jerry Seinfeld live is a bucket-list comedy
	 experience. This is a rare opportunity to see a true legend of the art fo
	rm perform in Grand Rapids. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2
	026 \nTime: 8:15 PM \nVenue: Acrisure Amphitheater\, 201 Market Ave SW\, G
	rand Rapids\, MI 49503 \nAge Restriction: All ages \nTicket Prices: Starti
	ng from $100 \nAbout Acrisure Amphitheater\nAcrisure Amphitheater is Grand
	 Rapids’ premier outdoor entertainment venue\, located at 201 Market Ave S
	W along the Grand River. With a capacity of approximately 12\,000 (includi
	ng lawn seating)\, it offers a stunning outdoor setting for world-class pe
	rformances under the summer sky. \nThe venue features reserved pavilion se
	ating\, general admission lawn areas\, multiple food and beverage options\
	, and beautiful views of the Grand River. Parking is available in nearby d
	owntown structures\, and the venue is easily accessible from downtown Gran
	d Rapids. Summer evenings at Acrisure Amphitheater are truly magical. \nA 
	Jerry Seinfeld show at an outdoor amphitheater on a summer evening in Gran
	d Rapids is an experience you won’t soon forget. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is
	 a solo stand-up comedy show featuring Jerry Seinfeld performing his full 
	headline set. Expect approximately 75–90 minutes of masterfully crafted ob
	servational comedy that showcases why Seinfeld is considered one of the al
	l-time greats. \nTickets for this show just went on sale on March 27\, 202
	6. Demand is expected to be extremely high — secure your seats as soon as 
	possible. Arrive early to enjoy the outdoor venue atmosphere and grab food
	 and drinks before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: Sta
	rting from $100 (fees may apply) \nSecure your seats through the official 
	Ticketmaster link or find resale tickets through VividSeats for flexible o
	ptions. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/eve
	nt/jerry-seinfeld-live-at-acrisure-amphitheater/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jerry-seinfeld-live-at-acrisure-amphit
	heater/
