	6 (General Admission & Premium) \nAbout Charleston White\nCharleston White
	 is a comedian\, activist\, and social media personality who has built a m
	assive following with his unfiltered takes on life\, culture\, and society
	. Rising from humble beginnings in Fort Worth\, Texas\, White has channele
	d his life experiences into a powerful comedic voice that resonates with a
	udiences across the country. His viral videos and live performances have e
	arned him millions of fans who appreciate his bold\, no-nonsense approach 
	to comedy and social commentary. \nWhat to Expect\n\nBold\, unfiltered sta
	nd-up comedy with real talk and real laughs\nPowerful storytelling rooted 
	in authentic life experiences\nHigh-energy performance that keeps the crow
	d engaged all night\nThought-provoking humor that challenges perspectives\
	nAn intimate comedy club experience at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\n\nVenu
	e Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s home for live stand-
	up comedy\, located at 5982 S Yale Ave. The intimate venue offers a full b
	ar and dining menu\, creating the perfect atmosphere for a memorable night
	 out. Every seat puts you close to the action. \nTicket Information\nTicke
	ts for Charleston White at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa start at $97 for Ge
	neral Admission and go up to $176 for Premium seating. Only 48 tickets rem
	ain — secure yours now! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post 
