	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nS.F. Comedy Showcase LIVE at Punch Line Comedy 
	Club\nThe beloved S.F. Comedy Showcase returns to the iconic Punch Line Co
	medy Club in San Francisco for a night packed with top-tier stand-up comed
	y. Featuring a rotating lineup of local favorites and touring comedians\, 
	this showcase is the perfect way to experience the best of Bay Area comedy
	. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors op
	en at 6:45 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 44
	4 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with val
	id government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \n
	About S.F. Comedy Showcase\nThe S.F. Comedy Showcase is a long-running ins
	titution at Punch Line Comedy Club\, featuring a curated lineup of some of
	 the best comedians performing in the Bay Area. Each show brings a fresh m
	ix of emerging talent and established names\, making every performance uni
	que and entertaining. \nWhat to Expect\n\nMultiple comedians performing ba
	ck-to-back sets\nA mix of local Bay Area talent and touring comedians\nInt
	imate club atmosphere at one of SF’s most storied venues\nFull bar and bev
	erage service available\n18+ show — valid photo ID required\nGeneral admis
	sion seating — first come\, first served\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line 
	Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the 
	West Coast\, located at 444 Battery Street in the heart of San Francisco’s
	 Financial District. The intimate setting ensures every seat has a great v
	iew of the stage. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $34. General Admi
	ssion seating is first-come\, first-served. There is a 2 beverage minimum 
	per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and Vivi
	dSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contain
